# Copy to `.env`. Both keys are required; `.env` is gitignored.

# The API. Staging shown; production has its own host.
BASE_URL=https://api.staging.gospeltube.tv

# The public CloudFront distribution that serves content assets.
#
# Feed rows for posts, events, devotional series, media series and creator
# avatars carry a bare storage key ("public/thumbnail/{creatorId}/{file}")
# rather than a URL — the key is the path of an object on this host. Without
# this, every non-media card renders with no artwork.
#
# Environment-specific: production must set its own. An unset value degrades
# to no artwork rather than pointing production at staging's bucket.
CDN_BASE_URL=https://d17puiamcqzhr0.cloudfront.net
